        "questionEn": "Which Sanskrit verse conveys this divine teaching?\n«All men and women of all castes are forever entitled to satsang, brahmavidyā and moksha . Do not attribute notions of superiority and inferiority based on varna . All persons should shun their ego based on their caste and serve one another. No one is superior and no one is inferior by birth. Therefore, one should not quarrel based on caste or class and should joyfully practice satsang. (14–16)»",
