        "questionEn": "Which Sanskrit verse conveys this divine teaching?\n«Shri Hari inspired the creation of mandirs as a form of devotion to foster and protect pure upāsanā and bhakti. He instructed that, along with Bhagwan, one should also serve his supreme devotee, Aksharbrahman, in the very same manner that one serves Bhagwan. (87–88)»",
