        "explanationEn": "This divine teaching is expressed in Shloka 90: «मन्दिराणां हि निर्माणं तदाज्ञामनुसृत्य च। दिव्यानां क्रियते भक्त्या सर्वकल्याणहेतुना॥»\nMeaning: To fulfill this ordinance and to grant moksha all, divine mandirs are devoutly constructed and the murti of Aksharbrahman is also ceremoniously consecrated with Purushottam Bhagwan in the central shrines [of these mandirs]. (90–91)",
        "fullSanskritDevanagari": "मन्दिराणां हि निर्माणं तदाज्ञामनुसृत्य च।\nदिव्यानां क्रियते भक्त्या सर्वकल्याणहेतुना॥ ९०॥",
