        "explanationEn": "This divine teaching is expressed in Shloka 194: «कर्तव्यं लेखनं सम्यक् स्वस्याऽऽयस्य व्ययस्य च। नियमाननुसृत्यैव प्रशासनकृतान् सदा॥»\nMeaning: One should always accurately keep accounts of one’s income and expenditure in accordance with government laws. (194)",
