        "explanationEn": "This divine teaching is expressed in Shloka 248: «चैत्रशुक्लनवम्यां हि कार्यं श्रीरामपूजनम्। कृष्णाऽष्टम्यां तु कर्तव्यं श्रावणे कृष्णपूजनम्॥»\nMeaning: On the day of Chaitra sud 9, one should offer pujan to Ramchandra Bhagwan. On the day of Shravan vad 8, one should offer pujan to Krishna Bhagwan. (248)",
