        "questionEn": "Which Sanskrit verse conveys this divine teaching?\n«One may go on a pilgrimage to Ayodhya, Mathura, Kashi, Kedarnath, Badrinath, Rameshwar and other sacred places according to one’s means and preferences. (260)»",
